the Most Merciful?\" But they are, from the remembrance of their Lord, turning away.","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":42,"sd":null},{"k":"21:43","t":"Or do they have gods to defend them other than Us? They are unable [even] to help themselves, nor can they be protected from Us.","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":43,"sd":null},{"k":"21:44","t":"But, [on the contrary], We have provided good things for these [disbelievers] and their fathers until life was prolonged for them. Then do they not see that We set upon the land, reducing it from its borders? Is it they who will overcome?","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":44,"sd":null}],"juz":17,"hizb":33,"surahs":[21],"sajdah":false}